<title>UK: Golden Castle sets $120 mln seven-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Golden Castle sets $120 mln seven-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   GOLDEN CASTLE EURO FINANCE LTD</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  FINANCE SECURITIES ASSURANCE INC</p>
<p> AMT    $120 MLN	BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    23.JUL.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +24 BP    PAY DATE    23.JUL.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY AAA	 ISS PRICE  PAR	 FULL FEES   40 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   AAA	 REOFFER    PAR</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMS US/UK/IT/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   TAX PROVS   NO GROSS UP</p>
<p> MGT/UND    40 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	ASSET BACKED</p>
<p>		SENIOR DEBT.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
